  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "There is some odd behaviour with world tags in the menu, in my testing the tags which can be clicked are dependant on the number of tags the world has:\n\n1 tag, it cannot be clicked.\n\n2 tags, both can be clicked.\n\n3 tags, only the 3rd tag can be clicked.\n\n4 tags, the 1st cannot be clicked but 2nd-4th can be clicked.\n\n5 tags, all 5 can be clicked.\n\nI've checked multiple worlds with varying numbers of tags and this appears to apply in every case. I noticed this in a previous update however never reported it until now so it is unclear which update caused this to break.",
